<title>USA: U.S. Stockpile sells 5,000 tons ferromanganese.</title>
<headline>U.S. Stockpile sells 5,000 tons ferromanganese.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Defense National Stockpile Center  sold 5,000 short tons of medium carbon ferro-manganese in a privately  negotiated sale to Glencore Inc for an approximate current market  value of $3.1 million.</p>
<p>The stockpile will make one more offering of approximately 5,000 tons  this fiscal year on September 9</p>
<p>((New York Commodity Desk, 212-859-1646))</p>
